The new patch is available for download, featuring a completely reworked UI, new particle and sound effects, and more!

[h1]Patch Notes[/h1]
[i]Graphics:[/i]
- [b]New UI[/b];
- Atlas' animations reworked;
- Additonal sound and particle effects.

[i]Gameplay:[/i]
- Field of view slightly increased;
- New standard camera angle (a little closer to Atlas' plane);
- When returning to a level nexus, Atlas will reapear near the last portal used.

